  "prefLabel": "Plc 1004.07 Examination Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Electricians’ Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1004.07 Examination Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Electricians’ Board. The examination fees for the professions regulated by electricians’ board under RSA 319-C shall be as follows:\n\n(a) For the journeyman electrician examination, $90;\n\n(b) For the master electrician examination, $90; and\n\n(c) For the electrician re-licensing examination, $70.\n\nSource. #14244, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14377, eff 10-8-25, EXPIRES: 10-8-35 (formerly Plc 1004.06)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
